<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen assaulted Atiku Abubakar’s convoy, killing one suspect, while vigilantes stopped a terrorist raid on a Kwara community. In Kaduna, terrorists abducted 68 people and killed 32 in a single LGA, and in Ekiti, Gbenga Hashim visited Sowore after an attack, warning of political violence. The military retrieved a cockpit voice recorder from a crashed plane that killed 25, and troops cleared insurgent hideouts in Borno. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOMUo1Z2VpMkpzZGNCYm5hb0VRNUxPdVZrN1I4ZzB1MUt5bURPN3lXVE0zOWJfWnQ4bFI1UlpkakxDYlhJaG9oUjZBblNvbFNRaHUxX2pFRkFsMUQ4NHNpQnBVa0U1Y1VEaWNiQm9JeXpsS2U5QkdBYm9aVWo4Yjl5OU5YTUlxOTFHSVhiVWpzdHNsdk5Vd3JtaHNNd2w5UTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOam1zbDE2MFpMb1hTNG9fUnZfbzR0WmxJclAyaWVLT1JmQnVnazJ0Y0xGRDY1NHc3cE5KYWMxMnh5LU1WZ1JXR09sM3BGd2Q2Ri1SWFJaTmYxU1IyZjBnYjVONDdEUjN2bFB4M0ZuVWd4S1Y4WlpzMGpSY0ExZkZpVWNoeVo0ZzVVMm5sMUpnQ2x4ZjMzc0NZU08xcmp3RUlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulse Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9qcVJ5RlkwMFc0cnhjUjBxWVdZX1VHeVk3b1htczI1bWJSbTh0M0cyS0YxS1RZdGxuT2xiMDd3TFNaejdZZ21ucm8xNGFzcUtFaFpSeEpvMkZnRG93dnJKREJsczJDd3JLQm1zZnc0N0phaGNBUDZF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNbTU2emtMczRaWXBOX2ZYdDk4UzdNMWl3eGZ0UmZ0amlBYVRPYjVtWm9wRjlyQk1tT1lwNmZNV21xV0I3SE5nRzFvRmZISkFreFNsN191UXREZ29leF9ibFAxNmZxV0FoMWVXOS0xN1ZnWGlacGl2bzZLTkZWRDE4YmFFTEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPcl9hWWlIcm9PMkJ4dFAxeTVDdHVkS212Nmg4cFIwNjZXUFF4TVp2RkdjTUZCWjlHMjY1empNRk4xTjFVWWhnYU1qYi